'''Hitomi Saionji''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]] and was created by a collaboration event between [[Kishidan Collaboration Event|Battle Cats and Kishidan]]. He could be unlocked by using a [[Serial Codes|serial code]] from Kishidan's CD (幸せにしかしねーから). He is no longer obtainable due to the removal of serial codes.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 164
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Hitomi Saionji
|name2 = Tommy & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Tommy & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Hitomi is virtually a weaker [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Kung Fu Cat]] on all fronts. Though Hitomi has decent stats, his recharge time massively drags down his usage below most other midrangers, including the aforementioned Kung Fu as well as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] and [[Actress Cat (Special Cat)|Actress Cat]]. Even [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]]'s superior stats and useful tankiness put Hitomi's usability in [[Empire of Cats]] into question, the only place Hitomi could even hypothetically be useful.


{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

